# Meal Planner Frontend

React + TypeScript SPA. FastAPI backend at `VITE_API_BASE_URL` (default `http://localhost:8000`).

**Stack:** Vite · Tailwind CSS v4 · MUI v9 · React Query v5 · React Router v7 · React Hook Form + Zod · Axios · Vitest + MSW

## Directory structure

```
src/
  components/        # Shared UI components (PascalCase, named exports)
  pages/             # Route-level components (one per route, default export ok)
  hooks/             # Custom hooks (useXxx.ts) — all useQuery/useMutation calls live here
  context/
    AuthContext.tsx  # Auth state + login/logout + unitSystem preference
  lib/
    api/
      client.ts      # Single Axios instance — never import Axios elsewhere
      authMode.ts    # usesBearerTokenAuth() per build env
      accessToken.ts # Bearer token storage (dev only)
      auth.ts        # login, register, logout, refresh
      mealPlans.ts   # CRUD + generate-recipes + generate-course-recipe
      recipes.ts     # CRUD + nutrition
      chat.ts        # sessions + messages
      grocery.ts     # list + items + export
      user.ts        # me, preferences
    queryKeys.ts     # All React Query key factories — never inline string arrays
  types/             # TypeScript types mirroring backend Pydantic schemas
  router.tsx         # Route definitions
  main.tsx           # QueryClientProvider + RouterProvider
```

## Routing

Public: `/login`, `/register`, `/auth/google/callback`
Authenticated (wrapped in `<RequireAuth>`): `/`, `/meal-plans/:id`, `/recipes`, `/recipes/:id`, `/grocery/:listId`, `/profile`

`<RequireAuth>` renders a full-page `CircularProgress` while `isLoading` is true. Never redirect before the `/users/me` query resolves — authenticated users get sent to `/login` on hard refresh otherwise.

## Cross-cutting conventions

See [docs/CONVENTIONS.md](../../docs/CONVENTIONS.md) for authoritative CONV-* entries:

- **[CONV-AUTH](../../docs/CONVENTIONS.md#conv-auth)** — auth transport differs by build env (Bearer in dev, cookie in prod)
- **[CONV-API-CLIENT](../../docs/CONVENTIONS.md#conv-api-client)** — one Axios instance only
- **[CONV-QUERY-KEYS](../../docs/CONVENTIONS.md#conv-query-keys)** — all keys in `queryKeys.ts`
- **[CONV-HOOKS](../../docs/CONVENTIONS.md#conv-hooks)** — useQuery/useMutation only in `src/hooks/`
- **[CONV-UNITS](../../docs/CONVENTIONS.md#conv-units)** — API always metric; display conversion only
- **[CONV-TYPES](../../docs/CONVENTIONS.md#conv-types)** — `*Read/*Create/*Update`; Zod schema is source of truth
- **[CONV-STYLING](../../docs/CONVENTIONS.md#conv-styling)** — Tailwind for layout, MUI for interactive, `tokens.ts` for color

## AuthContext shape

```ts
isAuthenticated: boolean   // true when /users/me resolves
isLoading: boolean         // true while /users/me is in flight
user: UserRead | null
unitSystem: UnitSystem     // from /users/preferences (separate query), default 'metric'
login(email, password): Promise<void>
logout(): Promise<void>    // POST /auth/logout → queryClient.clear() → navigate /login
```

## Testing

- Tests live in `src/__tests__/`, MSW in `src/__mocks__/`.
- Always use `renderWithProviders` — never bare `render`.
- Mock API with MSW — never mock React Query or Axios directly.
- Run with `npm run test:run` (single-pass) or `npm run test` (watch).
